    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Register and reader",
     "texto": [
      "The **register** is the form of language we choose in a situation. The level of formality can vary depending on the reader, the purpose and the channel."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Specialist texts",
     "texto": [
      "**Specialist terminology** adds precision, but it is worth explaining when the reader doesn't know the terms. Good **textual flow** makes it easy to follow the thread."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
